flowchart TD
    A[Define the task] --> B{Independent subtasks?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Start with Supervisor-Worker]
    B -->|No| D{Need explicit competing arguments?}

    D -->|Yes| E[Choose Debate]
    D -->|No| F{Need broad strategy exploration?}

    F -->|Yes| G[Choose Swarm]
    F -->|No| H{Need formal multi-party approval?}

    H -->|Yes| I[Choose Committee]
    H -->|No| J[Choose Peer-to-Peer]

    C --> K{Latency/cost acceptable?}
    E --> K
    G --> K
    I --> K
    J --> K

    K -->|Yes| L[Ship and monitor]
    K -->|No| M[Fallback to simpler pattern]